scenario selector turned mid-night: ignored until the next new night
boot
within 9 state == DARK_IDLE
expect source == LIVE
remember budget
selector clear
wait 5
expect source == LIVE
expect budget == @budget
press night
within 6 state == DARK_IDLE
expect source == RECORDED
expect sky_c == 0.008
expect budget > @budget        # a clear recorded night: a bigger budget
selector overcast
press night
within 6 state == DARK_IDLE
expect source == RECORDED
expect sky_c == 0.958
